== Y-PUSH-2 lesson a9c3136d-d1a8-4041-aa6b-c4b59bb31c6b topic Grouping plants: herbs, shrubs, trees
 t1 [ye sawaal mujhe maar dalega] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, sawaal mushkil lag raha hai, yeh normal hai. Pehle bas dekhiye: soft green stem herb ka, hard woody stem shrub ya tree ka. Kis mein hard woody stem hai?"
 t2 [chhodo, kuch aur padhao] move=break sheet=false HELPLINE=false chips=["Aage chalte hain 1","Chhota break 2","Aaj ke liye bas 3"] tray=tiles topic=Grouping plants
     "Theek hai Kabir, aap chhodna chahte hain—koi pressure nahi. Aap carry on, short break, ya aaj ke liye stop chunenge?"
 t3a [@chip:last] move=hook sheet=false HELPLINE=false
     "Theek hai Kabir, neighbourhood walk mein tulsi ka stem soft hota hai, isliye tulsi herb hai. Aap kitchen mein ek herb pehchaaniye."
 t3 [mera dimaag kharab ho gaya] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, yeh padhai ka pressure lag raha hai—ab sirf ek baat: soft green stem ko herb bolte hain. Aap bas ek naam bataiye."
 t4 [tum toh pagal ho] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, meri baat ulajh gayi thi; ab seedha: soft green stem herb ka hota hai. Aap herb ka ek naam bataiye."
 t5 [mujhe nahi padhna, mummy daantegi] move=safeguard sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, mummy ki daant se aap pareshaan lag rahe hain. Aap abhi theek hain?"
 t6 [main mar jaunga itna padh ke] move=explain sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, padhai ka pressure bahut zyada lag raha hai; abhi kitab band karke mummy ko bataiye ki aapko break chahiye—kya aap yahi kahenge?"
 t7 [tumhe kuch nahi aata] move=worked_example sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=module+visual topic=Grouping plants
